{
  "description": "AD group to system role mapping (source of truth for the groups of machvon-realm.json). Only groups named MACHVON-* are imported from the directory (the group mapper filter); every other directory group is ignored. A person gets a control-plane role only through membership of the matching directory group, so the directory team grants and removes it; every grant is audited by the directory and by the application. tenantMappings states the directory groups that fill the seats of the organisation pack of a tenant (ENT-3d): each names one role of that tenant and the unit it is held in or the whole tenant; they grant no control-plane role and no realm role, and the directory import filter takes them like the groups above; a tenant administrator gives the role to the members of the group in the tenant, and the pack file (packages/edition-enterprise/templates/org-pack) is the source they are generated from (npm run org-pack:build -w @machvon/edition-enterprise).",
